    <title>17. 一位山西嘉人的十年线下：永远欧气满满，永远热情澎湃</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a88dd7b1352af56ff3a0618</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a88dd7b1352af56ff3a0618</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 23:46:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>去年采访了一位深耕线下的优秀组织者，十年大唐粉，兢兢业业组织了很多线下活动，有生日应援、有嘉人见面会、有公益活动……她从分会管理走来，又跟一路同行的嘉人姐妹们创办了@嘉人宝宝只爱嘉伦。她有一颗赤子心，永远热泪盈眶。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">00:02:37</a> 嘉宾自我介绍；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">00:04:00</a> 嘉宾入坑经历；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">00:11:35</a> 线下欧气大爆发，见他，见他，再见他！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">00:30:08</a> 从参与者到组织者：当分会管理的二三事；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2163">00:36:03</a> 和嘉人姐妹们一起做公益 @嘉人宝宝只爱嘉伦；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4635">01:17:15</a> 嘉伦带来的能量，真的说不完；</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5022">01:23:42</a> 对嘉伦的爱，也真的说不完！</span></p><p><span>BGM：@任嘉伦Allen  《Drown in Love》</span></p><p><span>欢迎大嘉多多支持@嘉人宝宝只爱嘉伦</span></p><p><span>附上一些她们的应援、公益、聚会照片～～～</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlBlej8hnNPpZPWTzA6DOjfUaMDj.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh4yZVBCWaphKn8x_d7HFyPuDdBY.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft9hL13b3O2v5v9FsATh2o2Atrq7.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FozAp-BMsytsGORH7jDms-Nw-mI_.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi0-xQrw5ARYRcFrW21KO3e_4a11.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnm0HwS6DCQfnfW3fFKmO_z8mKiS.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqMrMCVSwIcn3HApWSjcU9-E6MKU.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiuwPcogl2PukE__cUeo7TaweO5l.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsqoihJoRyzNe0MscLGMMYVcjiUh.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvLp8x8xIqBw4Au0PGIOoMsvijxC.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu7UPGQDoiMVO1OdRyqYCLV92Qmc.JPG"><p></p>]]></description>
