    <guid isPermaLink="false">699667cfde29766da9e5da49</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Feb 2026 01:36:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又是一期积压已久的采访，但是最近线下见了嘉伦给了我力量，我又充满能量，把播客捡起来了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我要继续更新！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的嘉人是云南人，但是目前在苏州上大学，来听听她的追星历程和家乡的美食+旅游推荐吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:00:31</a> 自我介绍和入坑经历：因《请君》而来的周生粉；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">00:07:37</a> 打卡苏州《一生一世》和《暮色心约》的取景地；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="946">00:15:46</a> 第一次参与开机仪式，追线下好难忘；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">00:27:23</a> 佛山音乐节被取消，一定是让我在更好的舞台和超哥相见；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">00:30:44</a> 给家里人安利任嘉伦，跟嘉伦一起汲取能量是一种新型的追星方式；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2016">00:33:36</a> 那些年和超哥的错失；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2147">00:35:47</a> 昆明景点大推荐；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2729">00:45:29</a> 云南美食介绍：鲜花饼、米线、菌子（从吃菌子中毒说到小人国）、虫子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾BGM：任嘉伦《Fresh Boy》</span></p><span></span><p><span>#任嘉伦# rjl #任苒时光# &nbsp;@任嘉伦Allen</span></p>]]></description>
