  <item>
    <title>11. 课件打开，老师竟是我同担？王老师带你体验教学第一线安利任嘉伦～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e47df551d887b2291d2962</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e47df551d887b2291d2962</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Mar 2025 00:30:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾不愧是老师，表达顺畅，一气呵成，把自己生活中和嘉伦相关的点点滴滴娓娓道来。让我们直接从头听到尾，跟着王老师一路开心，一路满足，一路感动。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期show notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:00:35</a> 嘉宾自我介绍：嗓音独特的急救培训老师;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">00:06:48</a> 入坑历程：极度理性的反复纠结中毅然决然垂直入坑;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">00:32:32</a> 像嘉伦那样追寻梦想，开启祁连山般热血写作模式;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2525">00:42:05</a> 对于粉丝和偶像关系的独特见解：双向选择，双向奔赴;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3242">00:54:02</a> 永远带来惊喜的任国超;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3537">00:58:57</a> 和嘉人之间令人羡慕的友情;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3751">01:02:31</a> 在《嗨放派》激发的灵感下，开始沉浸式小说创作和自我提升之路;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4463">01:14:23</a> 全方位安利嘉伦的开始：自学剪辑+为每部剧写词;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4945">01:22:25</a> 课件里巧思安利嘉伦，收获满满正反馈;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6280">01:44:40</a> 小说名和笔名以及嘉宾对嘉伦诚挚的生日祝福！ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：任嘉伦《忘记冒险》</span></p><span></span><p><span>#任嘉伦流水迢迢#rjl</span></p><span></span><p><span>#任嘉伦芒果音乐节官宣#rjl</span></p><span></span><p><span>@任嘉伦Allen</span></p>]]></description>
