  <item>
    <title>05.学海中有“任”作舟，渡吾高中三年苦：刚结束高考的嘉人给你聊聊追星这三年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a2c9c27349f7a557945da7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a2c9c27349f7a557945da7</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Jul 2024 21:55:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当代高中生到底过的是什么地狱日子啊？说好的素质教育呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>粉其他人的不知道，但是粉任嘉伦的高中生还是很靠谱滴！</span></p><span></span><p><span>来听听这一期的嘉宾赟赟，一位刚刚高考完的嘉人，来分享一下她的高中经历吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:00:51</a> 嘉宾微博ID的由来；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">00:01:38</a> 想起曾经错过了嘉伦就痛心；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">00:06:37</a> 入坑过程；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">00:08:32</a> 每周末才能拿到手机做点产出；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">00:13:11</a> 高中吃饭洗漱都要卷起来；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="979">00:16:19</a> 浙江高考居然是赋分制，文理科还能混选；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">00:21:12</a> 嘉宾对自己高考分数的展望以及心仪专业是什么；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">00:27:05</a> 新时代铁窗泪以及学校奇葩规章制度；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2198">00:36:38</a> 假素质教育，真法外之地？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">00:40:39</a> 浙江高考有一月和六月两次？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2586">00:43:06</a> 任嘉伦是真正的精神支柱；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">00:46:50</a> 疫情之下的学校；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3325">00:55:25</a> 垂死病中惊坐起，只为抢任超专辑；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3464">00:57:44</a> 疫情期间网课趣事；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3604">01:00:04</a> 课堂上睡觉那些事儿；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4035">01:07:15</a> 对大学生活的一些展望；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4354">01:12:34</a> 饭圈产出都用啥软件剪辑和修图；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4928">01:22:08</a> 产出儿们痛并快乐着；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5195">01:26:35</a> 和411这个数字注定的缘分；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5488">01:31:28</a> 横店追嘉伦小记录：热心阿姨暖心照顾、等候时的小辛酸、横店的门票好贵、周边派发时的混乱、工作室给的奶茶真多、和可爱的嘉人面基。</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾BGM：任嘉伦《无愧》，From专辑《33》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lt0x7BApXe5CxByJpKmy3KKi3t3u.m4a" length="232708717" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:00:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlIj_YXEoNwqLOi7yIUPXmd-6en1.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>5</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>04.护士嘉人：在ICU负责拔管，也自告奋勇去过“非典”前线，然而最难的还是在老人科护理——你得会“忽悠”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66760f2bb6a8412729757a70</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66760f2bb6a8412729757a70</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Jun 2024 23:39:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期请来的嘉宾是一位来自新加坡的护士，在医院的各种科室工作了将近30年啦，也曾孜孜不倦地给学生们进行临床教育，现在又转战社区医疗，不断地自我挑战。来听听她在医院的各种难忘经历，看她如何靠“哄骗“来照顾老人们～～～</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大嘉收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">00:04:51</a> 对嘉伦无尽的喜爱，藏也藏不住；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="547">00:09:07</a> 如何走上护理之路以及开启各种新挑战的历程；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1153">00:19:13</a> 居然因为看了黑嘉伦的通稿而差点错过《锦衣之下》；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">00:30:00</a> 如何一步步把家属变“嘉属”；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2431">00:40:31</a> 周围的某些人对追星是不是有什么误解？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2798">00:46:38</a> 如何在老年科施展“忽悠”神功；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3702">01:01:42</a> 在脑科重症监护室NICU经历的一些至暗时刻；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3885">01:04:45</a> 投身临床医学教育领域；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4134">01:08:54</a> 期待嘉伦演一部金庸的武侠；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4266">01:11:06</a> 病房排班的工作让人身心俱疲； &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4383">01:13:03</a> 决定去社区进行上门医疗服务；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4566">01:16:06</a> 如何化解工作带来的负面情绪；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4792">01:19:52</a> 疫情期间累成猪以及自告奋勇去“非典”前线；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5099">01:24:59</a> 如果进了ICU，别救我，放我走；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5409">01:30:09</a> 姑息治疗；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5543">01:32:23</a> 在ICU做的最多的是拔管；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5653">01:34:13</a> 结尾闲聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾BGM：任嘉伦《无界》 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lp1F4QFL48lNwRaVtTwxp-7bjofq.m4a" length="185528581" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:36:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlIj_YXEoNwqLOi7yIUPXmd-6en1.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>4</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>03.告黑怎么那么久？遭遇“艳照门”？刚买的房子被查封了？听听律师嘉人怎么说～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666776b963c334a2fb9a302f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666776b963c334a2fb9a302f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Jun 2024 21:57:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期本人请来了一位律师姐姐，专业知识过硬，对很多法律事件侃侃而谈，但也内心柔软，说到顾川也会潸然泪下......律师姐姐讨论的问题有和饭圈相关的，比如网络侵权，也有和女性、婚姻、房屋买卖这些和三次元生活紧密相关的事情，很全面也很精彩！希望大嘉收听愉快～～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:00:59</a> 嘉宾自我介绍；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">00:01:27</a> &nbsp;入坑经历以及参加的线下活动；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1717">00:28:37</a> 关于告黑的法律程序；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3088">00:51:28</a> 遭遇“艳照门”该怎么办以及一些应对老赖的方法；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3656">01:00:56</a> 万一要离婚（呸呸呸），应该做好哪些方面的考虑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4516">01:15:16</a> 奇葩案例一之被中介坑惨了；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4827">01:20:27</a> 奇葩案例二之刚买的房子居然被查封？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4966">01:22:46</a> 闲聊之女律师被报复的风险高吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5169">01:26:09</a> 闲聊之心态年轻才是真的年轻；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5400">01:30:00</a> 结尾；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5451">01:30:51</a> 关于网络侵权案件管辖问题和嘉伦被篡改飞机座位的法律问题的补充。 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾BGM：任嘉伦《夕阳》 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
